OL,3,GNEWSAThe Darkness to headline festival 
OL,4,Aas homecoming gig                      
OL,6,FThe frontman of The Darkness says he   
OL,7,Fplans to be "as loud as possible" as   
OL,8,Fthe band prepares to play a homecoming 
OL,9,Fgig.                                   
OL,11,FThe band will headline the final night 
OL,12,Fof the Rock N Roll Circus festival on  
OL,13,F22 August 2027 at Earlham Park in      
OL,14,FNorwich.                               
OL,16,FJustin Hawkins, from Lowestoft, said   
OL,17,Fthat while it was rare to play an      
OL,18,Foutdoor event in East Anglia, he saw   
OL,19,Fhis first ever live concert in Norwich 
OL,20,Fwhen the hard rock band Thunder played 
OL,21,Fthe University of East Anglia in 1991. 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
